-- Step 8 of 10 - Approve, then apply, from your own terminal --------------------------------------
  The owner approves the package by its hash, then runs apply. Both commands are shown here; `y`
  copies the full command. No agent and no walkthrough can run them.
  Why this matters: Approval names the exact package: anything changed afterwards needs a new
  approval.
